## 5. USER PERSONAS

### 5.1 Primary Personas

#### Persona 1: Ahmed - Small Business Owner
**Bio:** 35-year-old, owns a real estate agency in Manama, Bahrain. Tech-savvy but time-constrained.

**Goals:**
- Find more property buyers and sellers
- Respond quickly to inquiries
- Close more deals with less effort
- Understand market trends

**Pain Points:**
- Spends hours manually searching for leads
- Misses inquiries when not at desk
- Difficult to track all conversations
- No way to qualify leads effectively

**Our Solution:**
- Automated lead generation from property portals
- AI-powered chatbot for 24/7 responses
- Unified inbox for all channels
- AI scoring to prioritize hot leads

**Quote:** "I need a system that works for me 24/7, so I can focus on closing deals, not finding them."

---

#### Persona 2: Fatima - Sales Manager
**Bio:** 40-year-old, manages a team of 10 sales reps at a retail company. Results-driven, data-focused.

**Goals:**
- Increase team productivity
- Improve lead quality
- Track performance metrics
- Reduce manual data entry

**Pain Points:**
- Team spends too much time on administrative tasks
- Hard to track which leads are worth pursuing
- No visibility into team performance
- Manual reporting is time-consuming

**Our Solution:**
- Automated lead distribution
- AI-powered lead scoring
- Team analytics dashboard
- Integration with existing CRM

**Quote:** "I need my team to spend 80% of their time selling, not 80% of their time on admin work."

