## 4. Core Features

### 4.1 Real-Time Chat Application
- **Instant Messaging:** Real-time text and media sharing via Socket.io
- **AI Chatbot:** Integrated with multiple LLMs (OpenAI, Gemini, Groq, Claude)
- **OTP Authentication:** Secure verification for user authentication
- **30+ Customizable Themes:** Using DaisyUI and TailwindCSS
- **User Search & Filters:** Find users and filter by online status
- **Media Uploads:** Cloudinary integration for profile images

### 4.2 AI Agent System

#### Lead Generation Sources (12 Sources)
| Source | Type | Status |
|--------|------|--------|
| Google Maps | Local Business | ✅ Implemented |
| Google Business | Local Business | ✅ Implemented |
| LinkedIn | Professional Network | ✅ Implemented |
| Instagram | Social Media | ✅ Implemented |
| Facebook | Social Media | ✅ Implemented |
| Dubizzle Bahrain | Classifieds | ✅ Implemented |
| OpenSooq Bahrain | Classifieds | ✅ Implemented |
| GDN Classifieds | Classifieds | ✅ Implemented |
| Expatriates Bahrain | Community | ✅ Implemented |
| Reddit r/Bahrain | Community | ✅ Implemented |
| Ask.com | Search/Community | ✅ Implemented |
| Custom Website | Web Scraping | ✅ Implemented |

#### AI Capabilities
- Lead scoring with AI analysis
- Automated email generation
- Conversation summarization
- Intent detection and routing
- Multi-language support

### 4.3 Multi-Channel Communication

| Channel | Features |
|---------|----------|
| WhatsApp Business API | Text, voice notes, images, templates |
| Web Chat Widget | Embeddable widget for any website |
| Instagram | Direct messages and comments |
| Facebook | Page messages and comments |
| Email | SMTP integration for outreach |
| Telegram | Bot integration |

### 4.4 Market Intelligence
- Competitor monitoring
- Real-time web data extraction
- Social media tracking
- Sentiment analysis
- Trend detection

### 4.5 MCP Server (40 Tools)
- **Chat Tools:** create_conversation, send_message, get_messages, list_conversations, search_users, mark_read, assign_agent
- **Lead Tools:** create_lead, get_leads, get_lead, update_lead, add_lead_note, log_lead_interaction, assign_lead, import_leads, generate_leads, get_lead_stats
- **AI Tools:** ai_chat, generate_email, analyze_lead, suggest_reply, search_knowledge, add_knowledge, web_search
- **WhatsApp Tools:** whatsapp_send_text, whatsapp_send_media, whatsapp_get_status, whatsapp_get_conversations
- **Email Tools:** send_email, send_otp_email, send_bulk_email, generate_outreach_email
- **Business Tools:** get_business, update_business, get_widget_config, update_widget_config
- **Analytics Tools:** get_dashboard_stats, get_lead_analytics, get_chat_analytics, get_conversion_funnel

