## 8. Dependencies

### External Services
- Apify API (lead scraping)
- OpenAI API (AI capabilities)
- Gemini API (AI capabilities)
- Groq API (fast inference)
- WhatsApp Business API (messaging)
- Cloudinary (media storage)
- MongoDB Atlas (database)

### API Keys Required
- `APIFY_TOKEN` - For lead generation scraping
- `OPENAI_API_KEY` - For AI capabilities
- `GEMINI_API_KEY` - For AI capabilities
- `GROQ_API_KEY` - For fast inference
- `WHATSAPP_TOKEN` - For WhatsApp Business API
- `CLOUDINARY_*` - For media storage

---

## 9. Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|------|--------|------------|
| API rate limits | High | Implement request queuing and throttling |
| Data privacy compliance | High | GDPR/CCPA compliance, data encryption |
| Platform API changes | Medium | Abstract API layers, monitor changes |
| Scalability issues | Medium | Horizontal scaling, caching, load balancing |
| AI hallucinations | Medium | Human-in-the-loop, confidence thresholds |

---

